  "solution": "Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>\n\t\t<br>Ta có bảng biến thiên của hàm số trên như sau \n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/361de79da1f94207af007499f35932aba40afaec2a361ec42d95ed3503a41b27.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tĐồ thị hàm số đã cho có hai điểm cực trị là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. \n\t\t<br>Từ đó, ta có đường thẳng đi qua hai điểm cực trị trên là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<br>Vậy điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> thuộc đường thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math>.",
